        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Übersetzungen im Translation Memory speichern</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Show languages, sources and progress" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Show languages, sources and progress</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Sprachen, Quellen und Fortschritt anzeigen</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Start the MCP server (stdio) for AI agents" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Start the MCP server (stdio) for AI agents</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">MCP-Server (stdio) für KI-Agenten starten</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Without a task, 'create' is run." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Without a task, 'create' is run.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Ohne Task wird 'create' ausgeführt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Options:" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Options:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Optionen:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Quiet mode. Only errors are shown." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Quiet mode. Only errors are shown.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Stiller Modus. Nur Fehler werden ausgegeben.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="ANSI mode (accepted; susi always writes UTF-8)." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>ANSI mode (accepted; susi always writes UTF-8).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">ANSI-Modus (wird akzeptiert; susi gibt immer UTF-8 aus).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Result code 2 on errors, 1 on warnings, otherwise 0.\nWithout -w: 1 on errors, otherwise 0." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Result code 2 on errors, 1 on warnings, otherwise 0.#lWithout -w: 1 on errors, otherwise 0.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Rückgabewert 2 bei Fehlern, 1 bei Warnungen, sonst 0.#lOhne -w: 1 bei Fehlern, sonst 0.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Show detailed error information." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Show detailed error information.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Detaillierte Fehlerinformationen anzeigen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Show help for a task, e.g. susi-cli export -h" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Show help for a task, e.g. susi-cli export -h</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Hilfe zu einem Task anzeigen, z. B. susi-cli export -h</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Do not save the project file, even if it was changed." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Do not save the project file, even if it was changed.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Projektdatei nicht speichern, auch wenn sie geändert wurde.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Save the project file even after an error." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Save the project file even after an error.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Projektdatei auch nach einem Fehler speichern.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Language of help and messages: en, de or auto (SUSI_LANG or system language).\nDefault: environment variable SUSI_LANG, then the language setting of\nthe Susi GUI, then the system language." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Language of help and messages: en, de or auto (SUSI_LANG or system language).#lDefault: environment variable SUSI_LANG, then the language setting of#lthe Susi GUI, then the system language.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Sprache von Hilfe und Meldungen: en, de oder auto (SUSI_LANG oder Systemsprache).#lStandard: Umgebungsvariable SUSI_LANG, dann die Spracheinstellung#lder Susi-Oberfläche, dann die Systemsprache.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Options can also be given in the form --lang=de,fr." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: general" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Options can also be given in the form --lang=de,fr.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Optionen können auch in der Form --lang=de,fr angegeben werden.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Language codes separated by ; (e.g. de;fr-CA). Default: all languages." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Language codes separated by ; (e.g. de;fr-CA). Default: all languages.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Sprachcodes, getrennt durch ; (z. B. de;fr-CA). Standard: alle Sprachen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Translation statuses, separated by ;:" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Translation statuses, separated by ;:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Übersetzungsstatus, getrennt durch ;:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Only these sources (names, separated by ;)." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Only these sources (names, separated by ;).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Nur diese Quellen (Namen, getrennt durch ;).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Skip these sources." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Skip these sources.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Diese Quellen auslassen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Replace existing translations." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Replace existing translations.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Vorhandene Übersetzungen ersetzen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Example:" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Example:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Beispiel:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Examples:" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Examples:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Beispiele:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Adds sources (.json, .resx, .po/.pot, .tsv, .properties, Android .xml; wildcards * and ? allowed) and scans them.\nIf the project does not exist, it is created." state="0" created="20261114182102" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Adds sources (.json, .resx, .po/.pot, .tsv, .properties, Android .xml; wildcards * and ? allowed) and scans them.#lIf the project does not exist, it is created.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261114182102" status="3">Fügt Quellen (.json, .resx, .po/.pot, .tsv, .properties, Android-.xml; Platzhalter * und ? erlaubt) hinzu und scannt sie.#lExistiert das Projekt nicht, wird es angelegt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Original language of the source (default: en)." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Original language of the source (default: en).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Originalsprache der Quelle (Standard: en).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="json, resx, po, tsv, properties or android (default: by file extension)." state="0" created="20261114182102" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>json, resx, po, tsv, properties or android (default: by file extension).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261114182102" status="3">json, resx, po, tsv, properties oder android (Standard: anhand der Dateiendung).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Creates the localized files (Project | Build)." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Creates the localized files (Project | Build).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Erstellt die lokalisierten Dateien (Projekt | Erstellen).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Translates duplicate strings with existing translations of the same original." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Translates duplicate strings with existing translations of the same original.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Übersetzt doppelte Zeichenfolgen mit bereits vorhandenen Übersetzungen desselben Originals.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Exports rows to a file: .xlsx (Excel), .csv, .txt (tab separated), .xlf/.xliff, .tmx.\nXLIFF with several languages creates one file per language (name.&lt;language&gt;.xlf)." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Exports rows to a file: .xlsx (Excel), .csv, .txt (tab separated), .xlf/.xliff, .tmx.#lXLIFF with several languages creates one file per language (name.&lt;language&gt;.xlf).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Exportiert Zeilen in eine Datei: .xlsx (Excel), .csv, .txt (Tab-getrennt), .xlf/.xliff, .tmx.#lXLIFF mit mehreren Sprachen erzeugt je Sprache eine Datei (name.&lt;sprache&gt;.xlf).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Row status:" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Row status:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Zeilenstatus:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="true = also export &quot;Do not translate&quot; rows" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>true = also export "Do not translate" rows</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">true = auch "Nicht übersetzen"-Zeilen exportieren</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Imports translations from .xlsx, .csv, .txt, .xlf/.xliff or .tmx.\nRows are matched by source+context, then context, then original text." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Imports translations from .xlsx, .csv, .txt, .xlf/.xliff or .tmx.#lRows are matched by source+context, then context, then original text.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Importiert Übersetzungen aus .xlsx, .csv, .txt, .xlf/.xliff oder .tmx.#lZeilen werden über Quelle+Kontext, dann Kontext, dann Originaltext zugeordnet.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Overwrite existing translations: 0 = never, 1..3 = yes (default)" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Overwrite existing translations: 0 = never, 1..3 = yes (default)</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Vorhandene Übersetzungen überschreiben: 0 = nie, 1..3 = ja (Standard)</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Status of imported texts without a status column:\n1 = Best guess, 2 = Auto translated, 3 = Translated (default),\n4 = For review, 5 = Complete" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Status of imported texts without a status column:#l1 = Best guess, 2 = Auto translated, 3 = Translated (default),#l4 = For review, 5 = Complete</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Status importierter Texte ohne Statusspalte:#l1 = Vorschlag, 2 = Automatisch übersetzt, 3 = Übersetzt (Standard),#l4 = Zur Prüfung, 5 = Abgeschlossen</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Import even if the original has changed." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Import even if the original has changed.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Auch importieren, wenn sich das Original geändert hat.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Do not import comments." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Do not import comments.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Keine Kommentare importieren.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Fills empty cells with pseudo translations (Column | Pseudo translation).\nUnknown languages are added as pseudo languages." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Fills empty cells with pseudo translations (Column | Pseudo translation).#lUnknown languages are added as pseudo languages.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Füllt leere Zellen mit Pseudo-Übersetzungen (Spalte | Pseudo-Übersetzung).#lUnbekannte Sprachen werden als Pseudo-Sprache angelegt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Also replace existing translations." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Also replace existing translations.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Auch vorhandene Übersetzungen ersetzen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Removes pseudo translations." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Removes pseudo translations.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Entfernt Pseudo-Übersetzungen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Removes unused rows (Project | Remove unused items)." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Removes unused rows (Project | Remove unused items).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Entfernt unbenutzte Zeilen (Projekt | Unbenutzte Einträge entfernen).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Creates a project report. Format by extension: .html, .txt, .json; without a file: output to stdout." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Creates a project report. Format by extension: .html, .txt, .json; without a file: output to stdout.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Erstellt einen Projektbericht. Format nach Endung: .html, .txt, .json; ohne Datei: Ausgabe auf stdout.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Scans the sources (new, changed and unused strings)." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Scans the sources (new, changed and unused strings).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Scannt die Quellen (neue, geänderte und unbenutzte Zeichenfolgen).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Translates untranslated rows from the translation memory (TMX).\nExact matches get the status &quot;Auto translated&quot;, fuzzy ones &quot;Best guess&quot;." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Translates untranslated rows from the translation memory (TMX).#lExact matches get the status "Auto translated", fuzzy ones "Best guess".</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Übersetzt nicht übersetzte Zeilen aus dem Translation Memory (TMX).#lExakte Treffer erhalten den Status "Automatisch übersetzt", unscharfe "Vorschlag".</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="TMX file (default: settings, %APPDATA%\\susi\\susi-tm.tmx)" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>TMX file (default: settings, %APPDATA%\susi\susi-tm.tmx)</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">TMX-Datei (Standard: Einstellungen, %APPDATA%\susi\susi-tm.tmx)</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Use fuzzy matches from N % (50..100)." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Use fuzzy matches from N % (50..100).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Unscharfe Treffer ab N % (50..100) verwenden.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Only &quot;tm&quot; is supported." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Only "tm" is supported.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Nur "tm" wird unterstützt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Validates translations (placeholders, tags, spaces, line breaks, punctuation, length, ...).\nErrors and warnings determine the result code (see -w)." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Validates translations (placeholders, tags, spaces, line breaks, punctuation, length, ...).#lErrors and warnings determine the result code (see -w).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Prüft Übersetzungen (Platzhalter, Tags, Leerzeichen, Zeilenumbrüche, Satzzeichen, Länge, ...).#lFehler und Warnungen bestimmen den Rückgabewert (siehe -w).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="All checks (including missing translations)." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>All checks (including missing translations).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Alle Prüfungen (inkl. fehlender Übersetzungen).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Default checks." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Default checks.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Standardprüfungen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Specific checks:" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Specific checks:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Bestimmte Prüfungen:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Saves translations to the translation memory." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Saves translations to the translation memory.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Speichert Übersetzungen im Translation Memory.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="TMX file" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>TMX file</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">TMX-Datei</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Default:" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Default:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Standard:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Shows languages, sources and the translation progress." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Shows languages, sources and the translation progress.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Zeigt Sprachen, Quellen und den Übersetzungsfortschritt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Starts the MCP server (Model Context Protocol) on stdin/stdout for AI agents." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Starts the MCP server (Model Context Protocol) on stdin/stdout for AI agents.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Startet den MCP-Server (Model Context Protocol) auf stdin/stdout für KI-Agenten.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Example configuration (mcp.json):" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Example configuration (mcp.json):</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Beispielkonfiguration (mcp.json):</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Unknown task '{name}'." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Help: tasks" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Unknown task '{name}'.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Unbekannter Task '{name}'.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Sisulizer exchange packages (.sle) are not supported – use 'export' (xlsx/xlf/tmx)." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Command line parsing" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Sisulizer exchange packages (.sle) are not supported – use 'export' (xlsx/xlf/tmx).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Sisulizer-Austauschpakete (.sle) werden nicht unterstützt – verwenden Sie 'export' (xlsx/xlf/tmx).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Merging projects is not supported yet." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Command line parsing" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Merging projects is not supported yet.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Das Zusammenführen von Projekten wird noch nicht unterstützt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="'sanitize' is not supported." state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Command line parsing" notereadonly="1">
        <native>'sanitize' is not supported.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">'sanitize' wird nicht unterstützt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Invalid value for -{name}: &quot;{value}&quot;" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Command line parsing" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Invalid value for -{name}: "{value}"</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Ungültiger Wert für -{name}: "{value}"</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Unknown option -{option} for task '{task}' (see: susi-cli {task} -h)" state="0" created="20261103155355" note="Command line parsing" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Unknown option -{option} for task '{task}' (see: susi-cli {task} -h)</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261103155355" status="3">Unbekannte Option -{option} für Task '{task}' (siehe: susi-cli {task} -h)</lang>
